+"""Authenticated, score-free specialist winner selection.
+
+This module is deliberately standalone.  It does not optimize parameters, size
+capital, mutate a winner book, or authorize live trading.  Its single job is to
+turn a precommitted, complete within-cell search and exact causal-fold evidence
+into a deterministic process-level winner (or an explicit no-winner result).
+
+The result is an offline book-selection calculation, not a live-trading
+authority.  The evaluator consumes only three domain-separated Ed25519 input
+envelopes: the precommitment, immutable all-attempt ledger, and exact post-cost
+evidence ledger.  Those signatures bind input provenance; they do not make a
+Python result object tamper-proof.  The declared deployment threat model is a
+single-user isolated process, so this module deliberately contains no runtime
+closure/code-integrity theatre and no output signer.  Book multiplicity,
+historical process validation, current refit, promotion, and capital controls
+remain separate downstream gates.
+"""
